{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11309690","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11309690","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130969001:1":{"text":"…그건 저도 알죠. ","source_cn":"……这我当然知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31494A84478EB3F8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130969002:1":{"text":"그나저나 좀 궁금하기도 해요. 왜 트라이브만 초코보를 길들일 수 있는 건지…","source_cn":"说来也奇怪。为什么擅长驯服陆行鸟的，都是蛮血呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A0F6DF449CF4E99","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130969003:1":{"text":"저도 그런 능력이 있으면 좋겠어요. 그걸로 장사하면 꽤 많은 돈을 벌 수 있을 텐데…","source_cn":"要是我也有这本事就好了。说不准，我还能做点生意，赚上不少钱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B0FFF86E99A3EB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:赏金猎人扬尼":{"text":"현상금 사냥꾼 요니","source":"赏金猎人扬尼","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}